        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "TradFi assets tokenized onchain",
          "why": "Fidelity NAV data, DTCC Canton Treasuries, SBI XRP bonds, and Fidelity's OnChain share class collectively signal that institutional tokenization moved from experiment to announced product, drawing readers tracking real capital flows."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "RWA looping and yield mechanics",
          "why": "The convergence of fixed-yield loans, RWA-backed leverage driving 30% of Ethereum lending, and the offchain data-gap systemic risk story attracted readers hunting both alpha and warning signs in the same trade."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Gamified onchain points quests",
          "why": "Convergence quests and FLOX blockspace incentives show readers actively following which protocols are running points campaigns, signaling intent to participate rather than just observe."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "AI oracles and agent infrastructure",
          "why": "ORA's onchain AI oracles and ConsoleKit's agent toolkit represent a nascent but clearly watched category where readers are tracking which layer-zero primitives for autonomous onchain action are winning."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Regulatory framing of onchain markets",
          "why": "The CLARITY Act tokenization warnings and the CFTC chair's 'base layer' framing attracted readers who understand that legislation will define which onchain business models survive, not technical merit alone."
        }
      ]
